{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_04_beg","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_04","title":"苦夜驚雷","storyCode":"IS-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"17af914598984042bbbdd6e448b8ba00d2e768729603652b98cb378903f596d6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，好了沒啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別催了啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚，這衣服好緊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會偷偷背著我吃披薩吃胖了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能啦！只是昨天晚上多吃了一片而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空，吸氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了！完美！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了嗎？快出來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來了來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，好漂亮啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的，簡直是完美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要是德克薩斯那傢伙也能看到就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不愧是空，這麼快就能在敘拉古的舞台上獲得演出機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《德克薩斯之死》這次採用了分幕演出的形式，第一幕已經順利排練完成了，後天就要演出了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是順利的話，說不定不是我去找她，反而變成她來找我了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能欸，我想想，到時候我一定要買個披薩拍她臉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到德克薩斯，我最近也一直在打聽貝洛內家族的事，這個家族最近的狀況好像有點不太好，希望她沒有受到什麼影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙肯定沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，現在也只能相信她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空的舞台首秀之前，我們可以好好休息一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本還想在這座城市裡多逛逛的，結果感覺我都成了空的貼身保鏢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪我哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是劇場的免費伙食被我蹭了不少，嘿嘿，披薩味道真不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺之後也會變得更忙，我們去到處走走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的女演員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你聽......嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的女演員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說的是......德克......對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的女演員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對，德克薩斯......判......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，請問你們剛才是不是提到了德克薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的女演員","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對啊，你也感興趣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的女演員","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是聽我貝洛內家族的男朋友說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的女演員","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"前幾天建設部部長不是遇害了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的女演員","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"好像兇手已經被找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的女演員","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"是那個德克薩斯家族最後的血脈，好像叫做什麼切利尼娜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這怎麼可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的女演員","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"開庭的日子也已經決定了，就在後天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂圖索少爺，我們約好的這場會面，可被你拖了好幾次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在抱歉，瓦拉赫先生，最近要我處理的事有些太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說你們讓手下撤出了不少之前和其他家族有摩擦的地盤，正在擔心你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你沒事，我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一點止損罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我就喜歡你這種謹慎的性格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，羅塞蒂家對趁人之危不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，有個問題，我不吐不快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必是德克薩斯的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“切利尼娜·德克薩斯”，她回來了，還是你的護衛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是她本人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我說是呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們從來都不知道，她原來還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當年，是我父親保下了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，原來如此，是他老人家的手筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座新城市的建造，本來也是因薩爾瓦多雷與敘拉古的緣分而起，家父也只是希望她能夠回到敘拉古看看這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不愧是貝洛內家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明知德克薩斯這個姓氏對羅塞蒂家族來說意義重大，卻就這樣落落大方地請了回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大氣，真的大氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我瓦拉赫今天算是服了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又在開玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩笑？這哪裡是玩笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜小姐還活著的消息，對我們羅塞蒂來說意義非凡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管貝洛內怎麼想，羅塞蒂都欠你們一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們兩家是將來要共同建設新城市的關係，有什麼欠與不欠的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好，說得好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，老弟你早就在這等著我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，你想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要的東西很簡單——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅塞蒂不要插手這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？要我們眼睜睜地看著最後的德克薩斯被審判，我恐怕沒有辦法向首領交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到審判結束後，她會被收押，你們仍然可以見到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是見到她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是我們的客人，但她也可以是羅塞蒂的客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，成交！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到，在這裡把切利尼娜搬了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是拉維妮婭的想法嗎？不......她不會不知道，切利尼娜不是兇手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以她的性格，她不會做出這個決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是萊昂說服了她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，無論如何，沒想到還有這一手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德米特里，現在，我們應該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要去暗殺切利尼娜嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道在七年前那場亂子裡，有多少家族的精銳折在她手上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偷襲、爆炸，或者乾脆下毒，或許我們總有些辦法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可別忘了，她歸根結底是誰請回來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是誰的主意，這確實很聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，只能用一些粗暴的辦法讓審判中止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歸根結底，我們的目的是讓城裡亂起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從一開始，挑釁西西里夫人就在我們的計劃之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，也只不過是把這一步提前了而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我倒覺得，還有別的方法哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼有趣的事情，能讓我也參加一下嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總監，德克薩斯的事情您知道了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是剛剛得知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道什麼內幕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少以我得到的消息來說，是拉維妮婭法官親口宣佈的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭，是那位幫助過我的法官小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......不像是會說謊的人，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要推掉你的首秀嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......能幫我想一想辦法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......至少先見一見她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"且不論你的首秀是否可以推遲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道的是，見到了又如何呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空小姐，我還記得，你曾經說過，你是為了與她重逢才與另外兩個朋友一起來到敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直相信著，你所見到的她，就是真正的她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，你已經知道，她隱藏的過去究竟如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你被迫發現，你所追逐的那個人，或許與你的想像相去甚遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見到她，又能怎麼樣呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能對她說些什麼，她又能對你說些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果真的是這樣，那麼恐怕，擅自想像的我也有責任，或許是我對她還不夠瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是對方對你有所隱瞞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也要看對方有沒有理由呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，貝納爾多先生，在演藝圈這個大染缸裡，我也算是見識過許多人啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要做到表裡如一實在是太難了，至少我認為我是做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我總是在想，有一天我也會變得身不由己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我從來都不會去要求別人這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每個人都會有秘密，我也有，她也有，想必，您也會有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果對方將他想要展現給我的一面貫徹到底，這難道不也是一種真誠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......誠然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，或許是我那時候沒有說清楚吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來找德克薩斯，不是想要責備她，不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們四個一起在龍門生活了快六年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這六年的生活對我來說是彌足珍貴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我至少相信，對她來說，也是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使如此，她卻依然不告而別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該為此憤怒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我很擔心她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使和可頌也是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們才會來到敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她被捲進了麻煩的事情裡，那我們就去幫助她脫身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她的過去沉重到能夠壓垮她，那我們就去和她一起承擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眾多劇作中，關於切利尼娜的末路雖然只是謠傳，但德克薩斯家族的末路卻是眾所周知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的過去恐怕比你想像的要深重得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們沒有親口聽到她這麼告訴我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她必須親口告訴我們，她的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這樣，當我們努力的最後結果依然是她要離開，那時，我才能心甘情願地和她告別呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我努力過了，我不後悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，大概還是會後悔吧，但不會那麼後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很有智慧，空小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是給自己的逞強找點藉口而已啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，和您這麼說了之後，我也感覺好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，現在即使我真的能見她，恐怕什麼也幫不了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，我都已經準備同意你的要求了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在審判之後，你會見到她的，我保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在，可能還要再等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，在那之前，我會好好準備的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真遺憾，我不能親眼看到你的首秀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？您不看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，那天，我恐怕會有一些重要的事情要處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你可以放心，我已經為你準備好了最好的舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"貝納爾多走到書架邊，從書架上抽出一本書。\n那是一本環繞著荊棘的法典。\n他沉默良久，最後，撥通一個電話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德米特，告訴她，就說，我答應了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"“轟”的一聲，窗外，雷聲翻湧。\n像是在預告著，大雨將至。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
